        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Сроки предупреждения о прекращении трудового договора по инициативе работника</h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaswcsehb/" data-dfa="dfaswcsehb"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr2/"></a>. </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="100%" class="bdAll"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasu7g2e7/" data-dfa="dfasu7g2e7"></a><strong>Категория работников</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfashpuoa3/" data-dfa="dfashpuoa3"></a><strong>Срок предупреждения о прекращении трудового договора (до даты увольнения)</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas1ntuf9/" data-dfa="dfas1ntuf9"></a><strong>Основание*</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasq684fk/" data-dfa="dfasq684fk"></a><strong>Руководитель организации</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasg84m2g/" data-dfa="dfasg84m2g"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за два месяца</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaseeqm8r/" data-dfa="dfaseeqm8r"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor5/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfassdk17k/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfassdk17k">Ч. 3</a> ст. 489 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasih2orb/" data-dfa="dfasih2orb"></a><strong>Заместитель руководителя, главный бухгалтер, руководитель структурного подразделения</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasz34cu4/" data-dfa="dfasz34cu4"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за один месяц</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas8oh6am/" data-dfa="dfas8oh6am"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor6/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasqyxnpc/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasqyxnpc">Ч. 4</a> ст. 489 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasuyma3u/" data-dfa="dfasuyma3u"></a><strong>Сезонный работник</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasgf43m7/" data-dfa="dfasgf43m7"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за три календарных дня</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasf3g0bg/" data-dfa="dfasf3g0bg"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor7/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasxb6usu/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasxb6usu">Ч. 1</a> ст. 494 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasafxv16/" data-dfa="dfasafxv16"></a><strong>Работник по срочному трудовому договору на срок до двух месяцев (временный работник)</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaswa5mcp/" data-dfa="dfaswa5mcp"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за три календарных дня</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasd3l9ed/" data-dfa="dfasd3l9ed"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor8/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfashygl1x/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfashygl1x">Ч. 1</a> ст. 499 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas0lmcs7/" data-dfa="dfas0lmcs7"></a><strong>Спортсмен</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas2o4802/" data-dfa="dfas2o4802"></a><strong>Определяется сторонами трудового договора</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas0eiti7/" data-dfa="dfas0eiti7"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor9/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasnhaozw/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasnhaozw">Ч. 15</a> ст. 503 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaswuaqf1/" data-dfa="dfaswuaqf1"></a><strong>Работник микрофирмы</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasm2089o/" data-dfa="dfasm2089o"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за одну неделю</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas3895bv/" data-dfa="dfas3895bv"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor10/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasvzo00q/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasvzo00q">Ч. 1</a> ст. 506 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasryhxgh/" data-dfa="dfasryhxgh"></a><strong>Работник индивидуального предпринимателя</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasg5bfhk/" data-dfa="dfasg5bfhk"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за одну неделю</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasyak78l/" data-dfa="dfasyak78l"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor11/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasignr3l/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasignr3l">Ч. 1</a> ст. 511 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas7dtpgw/" data-dfa="dfas7dtpgw"></a><strong>Домашний работник</strong></p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasbel67k/" data-dfa="dfasbel67k"></a><strong>Не позднее чем за одну неделю</strong></p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaskokfz2/" data-dfa="dfaskokfz2"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor12/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasifsxat/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasifsxat">Ч. 1</a> ст. 518 ТК</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 47%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasip9gun/" data-dfa="dfasip9gun"></a>Все остальные работники:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaspwb58z/" data-dfa="dfaspwb58z"></a>- общее правило</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasuqr314/" data-dfa="dfasuqr314"></a>-&nbsp;во время испытательного срока</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasrcvnqp/" data-dfa="dfasrcvnqp"></a>- при&nbsp;невозможности&nbsp;продолжения им работы</p></td><td style="width: 29.69%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasy027ho/" data-dfa="dfasy027ho"></a>Не позднее чем за 14 календарных дней</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaseobot5/" data-dfa="dfaseobot5"></a>Не позднее чем за три календарных дня</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasy39e20/" data-dfa="dfasy39e20"></a>В срок, о котором просит работник</p></td><td style="width: 22.28%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas5r478q/" data-dfa="dfas5r478q"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor13/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasearuw5/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasearuw5">Ч. 1</a> ст. 160 ТК</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfas3kfoqy/" data-dfa="dfas3kfoqy"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor15/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasi3xexv/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasi3xexv">Ч. 1</a> ст. 132 ТК</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfaslt3gd5/" data-dfa="dfaslt3gd5"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/backlinkanchor16/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfasp9wp3h/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfasp9wp3h">Ч. 8</a> ст. 160 ТК</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="scroller__track  scroller__track_h"><div class="scroller__bar scroller__bar_h"></div></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/210553/dfasg3came/" data-dfa="dfasg3came"></a>&nbsp;*&nbsp;Исчисление сроков начинается со следующего дня после календарной даты, которой определено его начало (ч. 2 ст. 9 ТК).</p></div></div><div xmlns="" class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 28.09.2026</div></body></html>